  "Three mods that add Derelict custom start, Remnant custom start, Omega custom start &amp; Threat custom start and put the player under their commission<br>Allow player interaction with Domain Mothership, Remnant Station, Coronal Hypershunt or Threat fleet with Fabricator Unit as semi-working station<br>Also allow player to pilot automated ships and have fleetwide immunity to solar corona and similar hazards<br>By default Derelict, Remnant, Omega &amp; Threat are hostile to most factions but there's a LunaLib settings to turn them peaceful to all but Pirates and Pathers<br>Inspired from the mod Crabshack's Remnant custom start<br><br>Dependencies are <strong>MagicLib</strong>, <strong>Graphicslib</strong>, <strong>LunaLib </strong> &amp; <strong>Nexerelin</strong><br><br>Can work with most mods that add Derelict, Remnant or Omega ships<br>Starts with an Automation XO with <strong>Second-in-Command</strong><br>Semi-works with Ashes of The Domain <strong>Question of Loyalty</strong> commission<br><br><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\" class=\"bbc_size\">Downloads:</span><br><a href=\"https://github.com/jason0320/Derelict-Start/releases\" class=\"bbc_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://github.com/jason0320/Derelict-Start/releases</a><br><a href=\"https://github.com/jason0320/Remnant-Start/releases\" class=\"bbc_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://github.com/jason0320/Remnant-Start/releases</a><br><a href=\"https://github.com/jason0320/Omega-Start/releases\" class=\"bbc_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://github.com/jason0320/Omega-Start/releases</a><br><a href=\"https://github.com/jason0320/Threat-Start/releases\" class=\"bbc_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://github.com/jason0320/Threat-Start/releases</a><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\" class=\"bbc_size\">Gallery:</span><br><div class=\"sp-wrap sp-wrap-default\"><div class=\"sp-head\">Spoiler</div><div class=\"